Third-party components
======================

edge-impulse-lib/ and firmware/nano_ble33_sense_camera/nano_ble33_sense_camera.ino
contain or are derived from the Edge Impulse SDK and its bundled dependencies
(TensorFlow Lite Micro, CMSIS, etc.). They remain under their original licences
(primarily Apache License 2.0) as stated in the headers and LICENSE files within
those directories. backend/ is built on the Laravel skeleton (MIT).
